# Template for local environment variables.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values on your own machine.
# Never commit .env: it is git-ignored on purpose.
#
# Relay needs no environment variables yet. When a feature needs one
# (for example a phone-notification topic in Stage 2), add its name here
# with a placeholder value, like this:
#
# EXAMPLE_SETTING=replace-me
